--- !u!114 &1568231428341593580
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3235309854401235365}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 11c0f7c906d6409449e122b8bb29dd29, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteReader
  prompt: Read journal
  title: Journal of J. Cross  -  Oct. 3rd, 1996
  body: 'The council wants the tower "secured." Fine. I built the lock into the mechanism
    itself. At the twelfth chime of midnight the upper floors seal and the boilers
    vent. Nothing gets out after that.


    I kept a spare key to this study inside
    the old clock. The case only opens when its hands show the hour I finally leave
    this place.


    The ticket is on the desk. I won''t miss that train.


    -
    J.C.'
